date-released: 2026-08-16
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/monteiro-sara/UROFND_UMAP-HDBSCAN"
url: "https://github.com/monteiro-sara/UROFND_UMAP-HDBSCAN"
abstract: >-
  A self-contained research notebook for standardizing prespecified clinical
  features, estimating a three-dimensional UMAP embedding, applying HDBSCAN,
  visualizing density-based profiles, and exporting reproducible model outputs.
keywords:
  - functional neurological disorder
  - UMAP
  - HDBSCAN
  - unsupervised learning
  - clustering
  - reproducible research
